{"id":"ozero","lemma":"озеро","pos":"noun","rank":2221,"glosses":["lake"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0a/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"озера","plural":"озёра"},"examples":[{"text":"Насколько глубоко это озеро?","en":"How deep is the lake?","words":[{"g":"how much, how"},{"g":"deep, deeply"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Мой дом у озера.","en":"My house is by the lake.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"at / by"},null]},{"text":"Там и тут есть красивые озёра.","en":"There are beautiful lakes here and there.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"beautiful, handsome","l":"красивый"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"here and there"]]},{"text":"Я хочу пойти на озеро.","en":"I want to go to the lake.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Перед моим домом есть озеро.","en":"There is a lake in front of my house.","words":[{"g":"in front of, before"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"house, building","l":"дом"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]}]}